  "content": {
    "title": "What's closed on Easter Sunday in Massachusetts? Target, Lowes more plan to close for day",
    "text": "April 18, 2025, 4:33 p.m. ETThis Sunday, millions of worshippers around the world will celebrate Easter.Easter Sunday is the culmination of a 40-day period of reflection and faith called Lent and celebrates the Resurrection of Jesus Christ, a widely recognized event in the Christian faith depicted in the New Testament.This year, Easter Sunday falls on April 20, 2025.While it is a widely celebrated holiday in the U.S., it is not a public, federal or state holiday. However, many businesses choose to observe the holy day and close their doors. It can be hard to know which places will be open and which will be closed on Easter Sunday.Here are the places that will be open and the places that will be closed on Easter Sunday.Is Market Basket open on Easter?All Market Basket stores will be closed on Easter Sunday, April 20, 2025, according to their website.Is Target open on Easter?No, Target stores will be closed on Easter Sunday this year, a company spokesperson confirmed to USA TODAY.Is Lowes open on Easter Sunday?Lowes is closing for Easter Sunday this year.Are TJ Maxx, Marshall's or HomeGoods open on Easter?No, all three stores will be closed on Easter Sunday, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Is Nordstrom open on Easter?All Nordstrom and Nordstrom Rack stores will be closed on Easter this year.Is JCPenney open on Easter?No, all JCPenney stores will be closed on Easter Sunday.Is Kohl's open on Easter?No, Kohl's stores will be closed on Sunday, April 20, a company spokesperson told USA TODAY.Is Burlington open on Easter?All Burlington stores will be closed on Easter, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Is Walmart open on Easter?Yes, Walmart will be open regular hours on Easter, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Are Costco or Sam's Club open on Easter?No, both Costco and Sam's Club warehouses will be closed on April 20.Are liquor stores open on Easter?Yes, in Massachusetts, liquor stores are be open on Easter Sunday, as it is not on the list of holidays where liquor stores must be closed.Is Petco open on Easter?Yes, Petco stores will be open regular hours on April 20, a company spokesperson confirmed to USA TODAY.Is PetSmart open on Easter?Yes, PetSmart stores will be open from 11 a.m. to 6 p.m. on Easter Sunday.Are Office Depot and OfficeMax open on Easter?All Office Depot and OfficeMax stores will be closed on Easter, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Rin Velasco is a trending reporter. Shse can be reached at rvelasco@gannett.com.",
